==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*tīraz}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*dey-}}.

Cognate with {{cog|non|tírr|t=glory, honour}} and {{cog|osx|tīr|t=glory, renown}}. Compare {{m+|gem-pro|*tiari-|t=neat, splendid}}, whence {{noncog|goh|ziari|t=neat, beautiful, splendid}}, {{noncog|goh|zierī}} ({{noncog|de|Zier|t=splendour, beauty}}), {{noncog|de|zieren|t=to decorate}}.<ref>{{R:gem:EDPG|tairi-|506}}</ref>

